                    : AppTheme.softShadow,
              ],
            ),
            child: Row(
              children: [
                Container(
                  width: 52,
                  height: 52,
                  decoration: BoxDecoration(
                    gradient: LinearGradient(
                      colors: [widget.color.withOpacity(0.8), widget.color],
