                                    '${_repairFormatDateTime(quotationData['callAt'] as Timestamp?)} '
                                    'with ${quotationData['calledWithName'] ?? '—'}',
                                  ),
                                  Text(
                                    'Planned Repair Date: '
                                    '${quotationData['plannedRepairDate'] is Timestamp ? _vehicleInspectionYmd((quotationData['plannedRepairDate'] as Timestamp).toDate()) : '—'}',
                                  ),
                                  const Divider(),
                                  Text('Parts Needed', style: AppText.caption.copyWith(fontWeight: FontWeight.bold)),
                                  ...((quotationData['partsList'] as List?) ?? const []).map((p) {
                                    final m = p as Map<String, dynamic>;
                                    return Padding(
